OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday will be damp and grey
OL,6,Fwith drizzly spells, and foggy
OL,7,Finterludes mainly along exposed coasts
OL,8,Fand hills. There may be brighter
OL,9,Fbreaks, particularly during the
OL,10,Fafternoon in the east, which will help
OL,11,Fto nudge temperatures higher. Feeling
OL,12,Fvery mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FDrizzly interludes will pass
OL,15,Fovernight. Heavy rain and strong winds
OL,16,Fwill reach the west and central areas
OL,17,Fby dawn, with some coastal gales
OL,18,Fpossible in the far west. Feeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
