OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA wet and windy start as
OL,6,Fheavy rain sweeps eastwards. Despite
OL,7,Fthe sunny spells, the afternoon will
OL,8,Ffeel cooler than on Monday with a
OL,9,Ffresh, gusty breeze following the rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FOn
OL,12,FWednesday, bright spells and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, and strong winds with coastal
OL,14,Fgales. Winds easing through Thursday,
OL,15,Fbut a band of heavy rain passes. A
OL,16,Fsunnier, more settled Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
